10 REM D-PLAYQUEUE: which PLAY state does BEEP reset? (C4 lasts 25 at T120, 12 at T255)
20 PLAY "T255O2L16V4":BEEP:TIME=0:PLAY "C":GOSUB 90:LPRINT "A";T
30 PLAY "T255":TIME=0:PLAY "C4":GOSUB 90:LPRINT "B";T
40 PLAY "T255":ON ERROR GOTO 100:ERROR 200
50 TIME=0:PLAY "C4":GOSUB 90:LPRINT "C";T:END
90 IF PLAY(0) THEN 90 ELSE T=TIME:RETURN
100 RESUME NEXT
